  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ポケモン好きのための　カップ。子供が　飲み物を　好き嫌いせず飲んでくれるので　親御さんも　大助かり。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "포켓몬 애호가를 위한 컵. 아이가 음료수를 가리지 않고 마실 수 있게 해 줘서 부모에게 큰 도움을 준다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "為寶可夢愛好者量身打造的水杯。它讓小孩子不挑嘴地喝下飲料，家長也因此輕鬆許多。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une tasse pour les fans de Pokémon. Les enfants s’en servent avec joie. Elle est donc particulièrement appréciée des parents.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diese Tasse ist ein absolutes Muss für Pokémon-Fans. Vor allem Eltern haben Grund zur Freude, denn Kinder trinken ohne zu murren daraus.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "La taza perfecta para los amantes de los Pokémon. Los niños beben cualquier cosa de ella, por lo que es una de las favoritas de aquellos con hijos.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tazza per amanti dei Pokémon. I bambini bevono qualsiasi cosa contenga senza fare tante storie, per la gioia dei genitori.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A cup for big-time Pokémon fans. Kids will happily drink out of it, making it a boon to parents.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ポケモン好きのための　カップ。子供が　飲み物を　好き嫌いせず飲んでくれるので　親御さんも　大助かり。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "为喜欢宝可梦的人而制作的杯子。靠这个杯子能让小孩不挑三拣四地乖乖喝东西，可帮父母一个大忙。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
